  ↓
Calculate square's number of 1s
using Prefix Sum
  ↓
ones <= k ?
 ┌───────┴───────┐
Yes              No
 ↓                ↓
Store radius     Decrease radius
Increase low     high = mid - 1
  ↓
Answer = 2 × radius + 1
